<title>UK: Trinidad &amp; Tobago sets $150 million 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>Trinidad &amp; Tobago sets $150 million 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Citibank International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   TRINIDAD AND TOBAGO</p>
<p> AMT	  $150 MLN  COUPON     8.00	MATURITY    19.DEC.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.323    PAY DATE    19.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.875     REOFFER    99.323    SPREAD	+175 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  T&amp;T	 TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.375     SELL CONC  0.50	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.50 PCT U.S. TREASURY NOTE DUE 15.OCT.06 -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
